[center][size=6][color=#93c47d][b]CSS v1.0.10[/b][/color][/size][/center]

[list]
[*]Hiding a garment can now switch off its physics too. Commander White's belt stops simulating while the belt is hidden, so it costs nothing.
[*]Hand support does less work every frame on outfits whose body rig it does not bind to.
[*]Outfits on an old version no longer turn grey or fall back after a game update. CSS now draws them with the game's own matching shaders automatically (Eve 1.5.0 and older, Unholy Genessa 0.3.0, Profane Proxima 0.2.1 and older, Commander White 0.1.1 and older). Updating the outfit still gives the best result. Thanks to Tifi, whose shader patch showed the way.
[/list]

Requires CSS Shared Assets 1.0.10.
